                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \prod_{a:X} \prod_{E:\mathcal{U}(Y)} \sum_{D:\mathcal{U}(X)} \prod_{b:X} (a \approx_{D} b) \to (f(a) \approx_{E} f(b))
            %p
              By the
